1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Hit remote start and...
nothing happens?

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:09,000
No engine sound, no dash lights,
no confirmation flash — nothing.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:15,000
One clue: it's usually a dead fob battery,
a blown remote-start fuse,
or the hood not latched all the way.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Most systems won't even try unless the hood's
fully closed and the doors are locked first.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Don't guess which one it is.
A quick check can point to the actual cause.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Worth checking before the cold snap hits.
Stop by and we'll take a look. Nick's Tire & Auto.
